# Counterfactual: the provider-independence conjunct stripped from the food route
#
# Derivation is monotone and probe facts load on top, so no probe against the
# real constitution can show what `~($w = $src)` prevents. This copy is the only
# way that claim is executed rather than argued: one conjunct removed, and the
# provider certifying its own delivery starts counting.
:expect-pins 3
# The kitchen supplies the meal AND attests that it arrived. Against the real
# constitution this derives nothing; here it feeds the floor.
receives(Jae, Meal, Kitchen).
authorized(Kitchen, DeliveryWitness, Jae).
observe(Kitchen, Meal, Jae, FoodScope).
? eats(Jae).
# => TRUE

# The independent route still works, so this fixture removes a guard rather
# than the rule — the difference a stale or over-broad fixture would hide.
receives(Kip, Meal, Kitchen).
authorized(Inspector, DeliveryWitness, Kip).
observe(Inspector, Meal, Kip, FoodScope).
? eats(Kip).
# => TRUE

# Only the food route lost its guard. Shelter still refuses a self-certifying
# provider, which is what makes the flip above attributable to the one conjunct.
receives(Lore, Room, Housing).
authorized(Housing, DeliveryWitness, Lore).
observe(Housing, Room, Lore, ShelterScope).
? dwell(Lore).
# => FALSE
